{"3788650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rosie Planet", "steam_appid": 3788650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Jam Packed full with Videogame</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rosie Planet is a videogame tribute to videogames. While the meat-and-potatoes gameplay is 3d platforming, it blends in elements of just about every videogame genre. Rosie Planet is a movie-theater-popcorn-bucket filled full with curveballs. Consider it the Nier of 3d platformers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788650/extras/a0b51e3f60ecce7c7447fb12274b11df.poster.avif?t=1772429826\" width=384 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788650/extras/a0b51e3f60ecce7c7447fb12274b11df.webm?t=1772429826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Explore a planet filled with 3D platforming joy!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A planet is a big place. In this huge cohesive world you'll get to drive all kinds of vehicles to get you from city to city... And then you can explore the cities too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788650/extras/e3de666ec39ebac5e92f604ffe23c695.poster.avif?t=1772429826\" width=384 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788650/extras/e3de666ec39ebac5e92f604ffe23c695.webm?t=1772429826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>What's in a city?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each city there are 5 linear action platform stages, and 5 hidden stars to collect. Collecting everything unlocks a minigame. As well, there are plenty of charming townspeople to talk to and things to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788650/extras/2720f53899d7b37a0448f1c0ad5f2318.poster.avif?t=1772429826\" width=384 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788650/extras/2720f53899d7b37a0448f1c0ad5f2318.webm?t=1772429826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Fixed Camera Platforming Delivers Driving Forward Momentum</strong></i><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action Stages in Rosie Planet feature a fixed camera. Inspired by Mario 3d World, this camera will always telegraph the action so that you can focus on the fast paced platforming. You'll never wonder where to go. You'll never have to break your flowstate with a camera adjustment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788650/extras/d60631be61f6e96e6d482dadc1342388.poster.avif?t=1772429826\" width=384 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788650/extras/d60631be61f6e96e6d482dadc1342388.webm?t=1772429826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Tons of atmosphere and variety</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Rosie Planet is a<i> world -</i> visually dense, atmospheric, and varied. Every area is filled with new sights to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788650/extras/385bbe2e09da4f5a1d5975e7d05d084d.poster.avif?t=1772429826\" width=384 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788650/extras/385bbe2e09da4f5a1d5975e7d05d084d.webm?t=1772429826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Jam Packed full with Videogame</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rosie Planet is a videogame tribute to videogames. While the meat-and-potatoes gameplay is 3d platforming, it blends in elements of just about every videogame genre. Rosie Planet is a movie-theater-popcorn-bucket filled full with curveballs. Consider it the Nier of 3d platformers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788650/extras/a0b51e3f60ecce7c7447fb12274b11df.poster.avif?t=1772429826\" width=384 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788650/extras/a0b51e3f60ecce7c7447fb12274b